    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1003">

                <pb facs="1160" n="964" sameAs="frus:frus1945Berlinv02/pg964"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">740.00119 Potsdam/8–645</note>
                <head>No. 1003<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">The President to the Deputy Military
                        Governor, United States Zone in Germany</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Clay</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Babelsberg</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1945-08-01">August 1, 1945</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Memorandum for General
                    Clay</hi></p>
                <p>The heads of government today agreed to the following: <quote rend="blockquote">
                        <p rendition="#flush">“Appropriate steps shall be taken by the Control
                            Council to exercise control and the power of disposition over German
                            owned external assets not already under the control of United Nations
                            which have taken part in the war against Germany.”<anchor n="1"
                                xml:id="d1003-f1"/></p></quote></p>
                <p>In order to carry out this agreement, you are directed to urge the Control
                    Council to issue the attached draft decree, which would <pb facs="1161" n="965"
                        xml:id="pg965"/> vest German external assets. I regard it as most urgent
                    that steps be taken immediately to exercise control and the power of disposition
                    over these assets.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Harry</hi> S. <hi
                            rendition="#small-caps">Truman</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d1003-a1.xml" xpointer="d1003-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
